A||N||26||AusFiero||My burnt baby is home. Also a stage 2 kit pic||||9||
Z||000000||AusFiero||12-13-2001||06:46 AM||||Well it is finally home for rebuilding.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero001.jpg">  <BR>Looks not to bad from a distance.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero002.jpg">  <BR>Looking worse the closer you get.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero003.jpg">  <BR>Closer still and the work starts to become apparent. May repair the bonnet (hood) as anew one is mega dollars here.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero004.jpg">  <BR>Dashboard is dead, so is the windscreen. Oh well it was time to make a custom dash anyway.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero005.jpg">  <BR>A salvaged pice of the stage 2 kit. A little warped but repairable. Other side is burnt around the edges as it was on my bench that burnt.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero006.jpg"> <BR>A custom nose from my MR2 shoved over the front to hide the damage. Wouldn't take much to make it fit.<P>Well I managed to save bits and pieces of the Stage 2 stuff so I am presently rebuilding. Hopefully very fast. A lot of work in front of me before my baby sees the road again.<P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero3.gif">        <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A><p>[This message has been edited by AusFiero (edited 12-13-2001).]||202.139.20.3||reg||9
Z||000001||Pyric||12-13-2001||06:56 AM||||I guess if you ever wanted to put a full body kit on it, now wouldn't be a bad time to start.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Sorry it happened though  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieronegS.jpg">   <P><BR>"Never offend people with style when you can offend them with substance." <BR>--Sam Brown||||reg||1
